<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan cotton output provisional 8.69 mln bales.</title>
<headline>Pakistan cotton output provisional 8.69 mln bales.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-run Cotton Export Corporation of Pakistan (CEC) said on Friday the country's 1996/97 (July-June) cotton output reached a provisional 8.69 million 375-lb bales.</p>
<p>This was down from 9.88 million a year ago.</p>
<p>Delivery and ginning figures in million bales (previous year's figures in brackets):</p>
<p>			Punjab	   Sindh	     Total</p>
<p> Delivery	 6.617 (8.132)  2.073  (1.748)  8.691  (9.881)</p>
<p> Pressed	  6.559 (8.112)  2.023  (1.708)  8.583  (9.821)</p>
<p> Mill sales     5.486 (6.546)  1.751  (1.218)  7.238  (7.765)</p>
<p> Export sales   0.006 (1.007)  0.0004 (0.415)  0.0067 (1.423)</p>
<p> CEC		nil   (nil)    nil    (nil)    nil    (nil)</p>
<p> Unsold	   1.124 (0.578)  0.321  (0.114)  1.446  (0.692)</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
